<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-BATEMAN WITHDRAWS FROM WELSH SIDE.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-BATEMAN WITHDRAWS FROM WELSH SIDE.</headline>
<dateline>CARDIFF 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Welsh centre Alan Bateman has pulled out of the side to meet Ireland in the Five Nations' championship on Saturday with a knee injury.</p>
<p>Gareth Thomas switches from the wing into the centres with Dafydd Thomas taking over on the left wing.</p>
